  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G02_s2042",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2042,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[calmly] 别动，别动。缠您法器上了。",
     "voice": {
      "voice_id": "ZUViBVrNG979RVVePz3R",
      "name": "Yuelao 10 (designed: gentle old uncle)"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H03_s2042",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2042,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "当年太忙。想着忙完这阵，就给自己绑一根。",
     "voice": {
      "voice_id": "ZUViBVrNG979RVVePz3R",
      "name": "Yuelao 10 (designed: gentle old uncle)"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H05_s2042",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2042,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "我这个……也记成，缘分未到吧。",
     "voice": {
